    "∫_1^3 s³/(1+s) ds = ∫_1^3 (s² − s + 1 − 1/(1+s)) ds = [s³/3 − s²/2 + s − ln(1+s)]_1^3 = 20/3 − ln 2.",
    "따라서 ∫_{1/2}^{27/4} g(t) dt = 81/4 − 1/2 − 20/3 + ln 2 = 157/12 + ln 2.  정답 ⑤"
